<title>USA: AOL silent on H&amp;R/CompuServe statement.</title>
<headline>AOL silent on H&amp;R/CompuServe statement.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Online Inc declined comment on H&amp;R Block Inc's statement Wednesday that H&amp;R and CompuServe Corp are in talks with a third party regarding a possible business combination involving CompuServe.</p>
<p>An AOL spokeswoman reiterated an earlier statement that the company does not comment on market rumors.</p>
<p>The Washington Post, citing industry sources, reported today that AOL was exploring the purchase of CompuServe.</p>
<p>H&amp;R Block owns about 80 percent of CompuServe.</p>
</text>
